flowchart TD
    Start([START])

    Start --> SM1["SystemMessage:<br/>USER_AGENT_PROMPT + hidden root intent"]
    SM1 --> UA1["User Agent<br/>(Initiates conversation with a root intent)"]
    UA1 --> HM_Out[Output: HumanMessage]
    HM_Out --> SM2["SystemMessage:<br/>ASSISTANT_AGENT_PROMPT + conversation<br/>Does NOT see root intent"]
    SM2 --> AA[Assistant Agent]
    AA --> Decision1{Tools Needed?}

    Decision1 -->|No| NoTools[Output: AIMessage<br/>text response]
    Decision1 -->|Yes| Tools[Output: AIMessage<br/>with tool_calls]

    NoTools --> HistoryCheck{Use Full History?}

    HistoryCheck -->|False| Brief["SystemMessage:<br/>USER_EVALUATION_PROMPT<br/>+ root intent + last_assistant_msg"]
    HistoryCheck -->|True| Full["SystemMessage:<br/>USER_EVALUATION_PROMPT_FULL_HISTORY<br/>+ root intent + full_conversation"]

    Brief --> UA2["User Agent<br/>(Evaluation >> Conversation Response)"]
    Full --> UA2

    UA2 --> HM1[Output: HumanMessage]

    HM1 --> Complete{Root Intent<br/>Objective Complete?}

    Complete -->|Yes| End([END])
    Complete -->|No, needs more| SM2

    Tools --> SM3["SystemMessage:<br/>SIMULATOR_AGENT_PROMPT<br/>+ tool_name + tool_args"]
    SM3 --> SA[Simulator Agent]
    SA --> TM[Output: ToolMessage]

    TM --> |Back to Assistant<br/>to process results| AA

